second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What does RSJ refer to?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 23, \"text\": \"and thirteenth seasons.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 24, \"end\": 175, \"text\": \"In 2018, Speight directed the season 13 episode \\\"Unfinished Business\\\" while playing the dual roles of Gabriel and Loki in the episode at the same time.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 176, \"end\": 296, \"text\": \"Speight has participated in several podcasts including Thrilling Adventure Hour (Episodes 148, 159, 165, 171, 195, 196).\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 297, \"end\": 331, \"text\": \"Speight plays the guitar and bass.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 332, \"end\": 464, \"text\": \"He has been in several bands, his first record as a cover band in high school, The Distortion Hawgs, where he performed lead vocals.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d00\", \"start\": 465, \"end\": 602, \"text\": \"In his college years, he was in the band Strange Neighbors with actor/harmonica player Tim Omundson, as well as in the band Fugitive Pope\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"Use app Back Biography Awards Trivia FAQ IMDbPro All topics Biography Richard Speight Jr.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"start\": 90, \"end\": 350, \"text\": \"Jump to Overview ( 3 ) Biography ( 1 ) Family ( 1 ) Trademarks ( 1 ) Trivia ( 6 ) Quotes ( 2 ) Edit Overview Born September 4 , 1970 · Nashville , Tennessee , USA Nicknames Dick Richie Rich Height 5′ 8″ ( 1.73 m ) Biography American actor Richard Speight , Jr.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"start\": 351, \"end\": 397, \"text\": \"was born and raised in Nashville , Tennessee .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"start\": 398, \"end\": 471, \"text\": \"He later graduated cum laude from the University of Southern California .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"start\": 472, \"end\": 508, \"text\": \"In addition to acting in TV and film\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 170, \"text\": \"item Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia American actor This biography of a living person needs additional citations for verification .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 171, \"end\": 211, \"text\": \"Please help by adding reliable sources .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 212, \"end\": 391, \"text\": \"Contentious material about living persons that is unsourced or poorly sourced must be removed immediately from the article and its talk page , especially if potentially libelous .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 392, \"end\": 429, \"text\": \"Find sources : `` Richard Speight Jr.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 430, \"end\": 562, \"text\": \"'' – news · newspapers · books · scholar · JSTOR ( February 2013 ) ( Learn how and when to remove this message ) Richard Speight Jr.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"start\": 563, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"Speight in 2016 Born\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 504, \"text\": \"2017 Salute to Supernatural Toronto 2017 Salute to Supernatural New Orleans 2017 Salute to Supernatural Washington DC 2017 Salute to Supernatural Honolulu 2017 All Hell Breaks Loose Christmas Sydney/Melbourne 2017 Salute to Supernatural San Francisco 2017 Salute to Supernatural Las Vegas 2018 Salute to Supernatural Seattle 2018 Salute to Supernatural Montreal 2018 Salute to Supernatural Nashville 2018 Salute to Supernatural Birmingham, UK 2018 Jus In Bello Italy 2018 External links Robert Downey Jr.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d03\", \"start\": 505, \"end\": 530, \"text\": \"on IMDb Robert Downey Jr.\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d03\", \"start\": 531, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"on Wikipedia Robert Downey Jr.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d03\", \"start\": 562, \"end\": 638, \"text\": \"on Actor's Life Fugitive Pope Fugitive Pope - \\\"Snow\\\" Video Clip Download the\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 111, \"text\": \"They realized that there was no support system in place for new and upcoming rock musicians and bands in India.\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 112, \"end\": 153, \"text\": \"They only had college fests as platforms.\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 154, \"end\": 245, \"text\": \"According to Sam, \\\"The community was large and strong but very fragmented at the same time.\"}, \"D5S4\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 246, \"end\": 372, \"text\": \"When we thought about this, we decided to come up with RSJ which would provide news about rock music anywhere in the country.\\\"\"}, \"D5S5\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 373, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"And thus \\\"RSJ\\\" was born to bring a sense of community among these struggling musicians, the first issue published from Allahabad in January 1993.\"}, \"D5S6\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 574, \"text\": \"It was initially planned as subscription-only magazine.\"}, \"D5S7\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d04\", \"start\": 575, \"end\": 592, \"text\": \"Amit promoted the\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"RSJ\", \"scope\": \"Biography\", \"claim\": \"RSJ refers to Richard Speight Jr.\", \"answer\": \"Richard Speight Jr.\", \"quote\": \"Use app Back Biography Awards Trivia FAQ IMDbPro All topics Biography Richard Speight Jr. Jump to Overview ( 3 ) Biography ( 1 ) Family ( 1 ) Trademarks ( 1 ) Trivia ( 6 ) Quotes ( 2 ) Edit Overview Born September 4 , 1970 · Nashville , Tennessee , USA Nicknames Dick Richie Rich Height 5′ 8″ ( 1.73 m ) Biography American actor Richard Speight , Jr.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0132-992d99b0af20:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"RSJ\", \"scope\": \"abbreviation\", \"claim\": \"RSJ refers to Richard Speight Jr.\", \"answer\": \"Richard Speight Jr.\", \"quote\": \"Find sources : `` Richard Speight Jr. '' – news · newspapers · books · scholar · JSTOR ( February 2013 ) ( Learn how and when to remove this message ) Richard Speight Jr.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Richard Speight Jr.\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\"